1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,744
The year 2045. Humanity has lost the Earth.

2
00:00:05,383 --> 00:00:10,542
The last survivors live in a colony on the
Moon, watching the planet that was once their home die.

3
00:00:11,883 --> 00:00:13,971
Do you think we'll ever get to go there?

4
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:17,887
It didn't happen overnight. Everyone thought
there was still time.

5
00:00:19,617 --> 00:00:24,617
We can send one person into the past. Only
one. And only once.

6
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,257
Destination: 2026.

7
00:00:31,483 --> 00:00:37,025
With real NASA Earth observation data, travel
to real places in Peru and around the world.

8
00:00:49,717 --> 00:00:56,663
Read the data. Check it against a second
source. And say out loud what is still unknown.

9
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:02,190
Decide with limited resources. There is no
single right answer.

10
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:08,462
You don't have to save the planet alone. You
have to make people want to save it with you.

11
00:01:30,283 --> 00:01:33,725
TERRA 2045. The Last Journey.

12
00:01:33,745 --> 00:01:38,056
The future is not written. But every decision
leaves a mark.
